{"id":"a8b1332dd97b2603","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FClosure.md","title":"FClosure","display":"FClosure","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FClosure","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r","a","b"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FClosure"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>a</span><span>b</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论公理代码。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>b</code>。</p>\n<p>确定的全称闭包；自由名按升序消去，外层量词顺序相应反向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FClosure E F R f r a b)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and (@ FWrapped E F R f r a b) (@ FSentence E F R f r b))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"53c6f94a73ab3e2c\" href=\"?note=53c6f94a73ab3e2c\" title=\"ZFC_FSentence\">FSentence</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ff0376e9e6bae5b\" href=\"?note=4ff0376e9e6bae5b\" title=\"ZFC_FWrapped\">FWrapped</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"